                      <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"></path></svg>
                      <div>
                        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">Evidence-based approach</p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Ask whether they use CBT (Cognitive Behavioural Therapy), ACT, psychodynamic therapy or EMDR. These are approaches with strong research backing for anxiety and depression. Be cautious of vague answers about "holistic" or unnamed methods.</p>
                      </div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                      <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"></path></svg>
                      <div>
                        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">English fluency (if needed)</p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Therapy in a second language is genuinely harder. Subtle emotions, idioms and nuance matter enormously. If English is your working language, insist on a native or highly fluent speaker.</p>
                      </div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                      <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"></path></svg>
                      <div>
                        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">Clear confidentiality policy</p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Before starting, ask explicitly: what is shared, with whom, under what circumstances? A professional psychologist will have a clear, written confidentiality agreement ready for you.</p>
                      </div>
                    </li>
                  </ul>
